# Real Adventure

Authentic outdoor exploration, challenge, discovery, and journeying into the wild.

**Best MDI icons:** `hiking`, `mountain`, `compass`, `map-marker-path`, `campfire`, `tent`

**Vibe:** Exploration • Wilderness • Achievement • Discovery • Adventure

---

# Whitewater Rafting

Fast-moving rivers, excitement, outdoor adventure, and guided experiences on the water.

**Best MDI icons:** `kayak`, `river`, `wave`, `mountain`, `hiking`, `compass`, `map-marker-path`, `tent`, `campfire`, `lifebuoy`

**Vibe:** Rapids • Adventure • Nature • Exploration • Safety

---

# Expedition & Discovery

Finding new places, following routes, and venturing beyond the familiar.

**Best MDI icons:** `compass`, `map`, `map-marker-path`, `trail-sign`, `mountain`

**Vibe:** Navigation • Discovery • Journey • Exploration

---

# Camping & Multi-Day Trips

Immersive outdoor experiences that extend beyond a single day.

**Best MDI icons:** `tent`, `campfire`, `forest`, `pine-tree`, `tree`

**Vibe:** Wilderness • Overnight Adventure • Nature • Connection

