# Safety & Expert Guides

Professional leadership, preparation, and confidence in challenging environments.

**Best MDI icons:** `lifebuoy`, `helmet`, `shield-check`, `account-tie`, `account-group`

**Vibe:** Trust • Expertise • Protection • Guidance

---

# Wildlife & Nature

Experiencing natural ecosystems and the outdoors up close.

**Best MDI icons:** `fish`, `bird`, `paw`, `leaf`, `nature`

